### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### VALIDATION LOGS API
### ============================================================

### Get daily summary (last 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/validation-logs/daily-summary?days=7
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get recent validation logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/validation-logs/recent?take=10
Cookie: {{token}}
